iv class="nuxt-loading-indicator" style="position:fixed;top:0;right:0;left:0;pointer-events:none;width:auto;height:3px;opacity:0;background:#fb7738;background-size:Infinity% auto;transform:scaleX(0%);transform-origin:left;transition:transform 0.1s, height 0.4s, opacity 0.4s;z-index:999999;" data-v-aaad6a58></div><div class="blog content-max-1356" data-v-5a9e72da><div class="breadcrumb-wrap" data-v-5a9e72da><div class="hh-row" style="margin-left:-10px;margin-right:-10px;" data-v-5a9e72da><!--[--><div class="hh-col hh-col-24 is-guttered" style="padding-right:10px;padding-left:10px;" data-v-5a9e72da><!--[--><div class="hh-breadcrumb blog-header" aria-label="Breadcrumb" role="navigation" data-v-5a9e72da><!--[--><span class="hh-breadcrumb__item" data-v-5a9e72da><span class="hh-breadcrumb__inner" role="link"><!--[--><a href="/" data-v-5a9e72da>Home</a><!--]--></span><span class="hh-breadcrumb__separator" role="presentation">/</span></span><span class="hh-breadcrumb__item" data-v-5a9e72da><span class="hh-breadcrumb__inner" role="link"><!--[--><a href="/manual" data-v-5a9e72da>User Manual</a><!--]--></span><span class="hh-breadcrumb__separator" role="presentation">/</span></span><span class="hh-breadcrumb__item" data-v-5a9e72da><span class="hh-breadcrumb__inner" role="link"><!--[-->Purchasing service Of HandHunt<!--]--></span><span class="hh-breadcrumb__separator" role="presentation">/</span></span><!--]--></div><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></div><div class="hh-row" style="margin-left:-10px;margin-right:-10px;" data-v-5a9e72da><!--[--><div class="hh-col hh-col-5 is-guttered blog-side" style="padding-right:10px;padding-left:10px;" data-v-5a9e72da><!--[--><div class="blog-menu-wrap" data-v-5a9e72da data-v-82643001><div class="blogs-side-item" data-v-82643001><div class="blogs-side-item-sub" data-v-82643001>Catalog</div><div class="blog-menu-list" data-v-82643001><!--[--><a class="manual-menu active" title="Purchasing service Of HandHunt" href="/manual/handhunt-purchasing-service" data-v-82643001> · Purchasing service Of HandHunt</a><a class="manual-menu" title="Transshipment business Of HandHunt" href="/manual/handhunt-transshipment-business" data-v-82643001> · Transshipment business Of HandHunt</a><a class="manual-menu" title="Introduction to customs duties" href="/manual/introduction-to-customs-duties" data-v-82643001> · Introduction to customs duties</a><a class="manual-menu" title="Mailing restrictions" href="/manual/handhunt-mailing-restrictions" data-v-82643001> · Mailing restrictions</a><a class="manual-menu" title="Value-added services of HandHunt" href="/manual/value-added-services" data-v-82643001> · Value-added services of HandHunt</a><a class="manual-menu" title="Storage period of goods" href="/manual/storage-period-of-goods" data-v-82643001> · Storage period of goods</a><a class="manual-menu" title="Declaration of Forbidden Items for Purchase" href="/manual/declaration-of-forbidden-items-for-purchase" data-v-82643001> · Declaration of Forbidden Items for Purchase</a><a class="manual-menu" title="What is Consolidation Shipping Service?" href="/manual/what-is-consolidation-shipping-service" data-v-82643001> · What is Consolidation Shipping Service?</a><a class="manual-menu" title="What is Purchasing Agent Service? What is the Process?" href="/manual/what-is-purchasing-agent-service-what-is-the-process" data-v-82643001> · What is Purchasing Agent Service? What is the Process?</a><a class="manual-menu" title="Shipping Restrictions" href="/manual/shipping-restrictions" data-v-82643001> · Shipping Restrictions</a><a class="manual-menu" title="Disclaimer" href="/manual/disclaimer" data-v-82643001> · Disclaimer</a><!--]--></div></div></div><!--]--></div><div class="hh-col hh-col-14 is-guttered" style="padding-right:10px;padding-left:10px;" data-v-5a9e72da><!--[--><div class="blog-content" data-v-5a9e72da><h1 class="font-bold" data-v-5a9e72da>Purchasing service Of HandHunt</h1><div class="blog-detail flex" data-v-5a9e72da><span class="hh-avatar hh-avatar--circle author-icon" style="--hh-avatar-size:50px;" data-v-5a9e72da><img src="https://static-global.zingfront.com/handhunt/static/img/ogImage.png" style="object-fit:contain;"></span><div class="flex flex-col items-start justify-between" data-v-5a9e72da><h3 class="author-name" data-v-5a9e72da>HandHunt</h3><div class="release-date" data-v-5a9e72da>Published Jun 20, 2024</div></div><div class="read-time flex" data-v-5a9e72da><i class="hh-icon" style="font-size:20px;--color:#0009;" data-v-5a9e72da><!--[--><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" data-v-5a9e72da><path fill="currentColor" d="M512 896a320 320 0 1 0 0-640 320 320 0 0 0 0 640m0 64a384 384 0 1 1 0-768 384 384 0 0 1 0 768"></path><path fill="currentColor" d="M512 320a32 32 0 0 1 32 32l-.512 224a32 32 0 1 1-64 0L480 352a32 32 0 0 1 32-32"></path><path fill="currentColor" d="M448 576a64 64 0 1 0 128 0 64 64 0 1 0-128 0m96-448v128h-64V128h-96a32 32 0 0 1 0-64h256a32 32 0 1 1 0 64z"></path></svg><!--]--></i> Estimated reading time: 22 minutes</div></div><div id="tinymce" class="mce-content-body no-reset" data-v-5a9e72da><article><h2  class="4ever-article" data-identifier-application__slash__x-doc-key="3M0OzBE0Ga06OzeE" id="How-long-will-it-take-for-the-merchant-to-ship-the-ordered-goods-2" attr-anchor="1" ><span style="font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;" data-type="text">How long will it take for the merchant to ship the ordered goods?</span></h2>

<p style=""><span data-type="text">Domestic Taobao sellers generally ship within 3 to 7 days (except for some customized and pre-sale items)</span></p>
<p style=""><span data-type="text">1688 self-operated logistics will ship on the same day (non-self-operated, franchised merchants ship within 3-5 days)</span></p>
<h2  id="How-long-will-it-take-for-the-shipped-goods-to-be-delivered-to-HandHunt-2" attr-anchor="1" ><span style="font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;" data-type="text">How long will it take for the shipped goods to be delivered to HandHunt?</span></h2>
<p style=""><span data-type="text">The HandHunt warehouse is located in Wuhan, Hubei</span></p>
<p style=""><span data-type="text">For shipments from Central China, it usually takes 1-2 working days to arrive. For shipments from the Pearl River Delta, it usually takes 2-4 working days to arrive. For shipments from the Yangtze River Delta, it usually takes 3-5 working days to arrive. For shipments from other remote areas, it usually takes about 5-10 working days to arrive.</span></p>
<p style=""><span data-type="text">Please note that the above time is only an estimate, and the actual time may vary due to weather, traffic and other factors.</span></p>
<h2  id="Purchasing-Disclaimer-2" attr-anchor="1" ><span style="font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;" data-type="text">Purchasing Disclaimer</span></h2>
<p style=""><span data-type="text">HandHunt is committed to eliminating all your worries about international online shopping. In order to ensure that the goods you purchased can be received smoothly, we will have corresponding processing standards for the goods that have arrived. Since Taobao and other similar websites may have illegal commercial practices, please shop with caution; the following special circumstances are deemed to be your consent and follow-up operations. If you have any doubts, please contact the customer service staff to verify when submitting the order.</span></p>
<h4  style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 85%; margin-top: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px; " id="Sensitive-goods1-4" attr-anchor="1" ><span style="font-size: 12pt;" data-type="text">1. Sensitive goods:</span></h4>
<p style=""><span data-type="text">Containing sensitive items such as essential oils, care solutions, lubricants, batteries, glue, etc., in order to ensure your normal delivery, we will take them out for you.</span></p>
<h4  style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 85%; margin-top: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px; " id="Customs-policy2-4" attr-anchor="1" ><span style="font-size: 12pt;" data-type="text">2. Customs policy:</span></h4>
<p style=""><span data-type="text">Containing brands, large amounts of liquids\powders, live goods, food\drugs, etc. may be subject to certain shipping risks due to customs policies. If the consequences arise from the above risks, this site is not responsible for customs clearance and bears relevant legal responsibilities.</span></p>
<h4  style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 85%; margin-top: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px; " id="Unable-to-professionally-inspect-goods3-4" attr-anchor="1" ><span style="font-size: 12pt;" data-type="text">3. Unable to professionally inspect goods:</span></h4>
<p style=""><span data-type="text">If you purchase electrical appliances, brands, tickets, cards, models and other goods, we will not be able to conduct professional (quality, authenticity, integrity, etc.) inspections for the goods you ordered; when the quality inspector inspects the goods, he can only check whether the appearance of the goods is intact and whether the accessories are complete, but cannot turn on the machine to check whether the goods have quality problems.</span></p>
<h4  style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 85%; margin-top: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px; " id="Fragile-items4-4" attr-anchor="1" ><span style="font-size: 12pt;" data-type="text">4. Fragile items:</span></h4>
<p style=""><span data-type="text">Containing ceramics, glass products, irregularly shaped products (wipers, car fenders, etc.), etc., the products may be worn and broken during transportation. Please purchase with caution. We guarantee the integrity of the products before delivery, but if the products are damaged during delivery and are judged as fragile by logistics, the losses incurred shall be borne by you.</span></p>
<h4  style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.45; " id="Customized-products5-4" attr-anchor="1" ><span style="font-size: 12pt;" data-type="text">5. Customized products:</span></h4>
<p style=""><span data-type="text">If the order you submit is a customized product, it is recommended that you negotiate with the merchant. Order the product according to your ideas and creativity. After successful negotiation with the merchant, you need to provide the merchant's Wangwang, contact information or code. We cannot conduct professional inspections for such products for you, and the losses incurred shall be borne by you.</span></p>
<h4  style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.45; " id="Deposit-order6-4" attr-anchor="1" ><span style="font-size: 12pt;" data-type="text">6. Deposit order:</span></h4>
<p style=""><span data-type="text">Due to the regulations of Taobao sellers, deposit orders cannot be cancelled after being photographed, and you need to follow up the information released by the seller to make up the balance before delivery. If the balance is not paid within the time limit, the deposit will not be refunded.</span></p>
<h4  style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.45; " id="Low-seller-reputation7-4" attr-anchor="1" ><span style="font-size: 12pt;" data-type="text">7. Low seller reputation:</span></h4>
<p style=""><span data-type="text">It is recommended that you choose a store with a store reputation of more than three hearts and pay a Taobao deposit to purchase goods. Stores with low merchant credibility and no insurance premiums may have disputes such as sellers not shipping, false shipping, after-sales, and rights protection. You will be responsible for any losses incurred.</span></p>
<h4  style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.45; " id="CD-and-hand-made-products8-4" attr-anchor="1" ><span style="font-size: 12pt;" data-type="text">8. "CD" and "hand-made" products:</span></h4>
<p style=""><span data-type="text">Since "CD" and "hand-made" products have high collection value, in order not to affect the user's collection, the inspection standard for such products is not to remove the plastic bag for inspection. Only the appearance can be inspected for damage, and the details of the internal parts cannot be specifically verified. The risks incurred shall be borne by you.</span></p>
<p style=""><span data-type="text">If the order you submit has the above risks, we will regard you as having read and accepted the above terms. Please be sure to read them carefully. HandHunt reserves all rights of interpretation!</span></p>
<span style="font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;" data-type="text">Parcel Transshipment Inspection Rules</span>
<h4  style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.45; " id="Receipt-Inspection-Rules-4" attr-anchor="1" ><span style="font-size: 12pt;" data-type="text">Receipt Inspection Rules:</span></h4>
<p style=""><span data-type="text">1. When signing for a parcel, if the outer packaging is found to be severely damaged or other goods that do not meet the delivery requirements, the warehouse staff will directly refuse to accept or return the goods.</span></p>
<p style=""><span data-type="text">2. If your parcel meets the delivery requirements, the warehouse will unpack all parcels for prohibited items after receiving the goods, and then weigh them for storage.</span></p>
<p style=""><span data-type="text">3. If it is found that your goods do not meet the requirements of transportation and air transportation, we will make a special mark on the relevant order to remind you to negotiate the return.</span></p>
<p style=""><span data-type="text">4. If you have not found the warehouse's delivery information within a reasonable domestic delivery time (generally the domestic delivery cycle is 3-5 days), please contact your sender/domestic logistics company or website customer service staff to confirm the status of the goods.</span></p>
<h4  style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.45; " id="Inspection-and-warehousing-instructions-4" attr-anchor="1" ><span style="font-size: 12pt;" data-type="text">Inspection and warehousing instructions</span></h4>
<p style=""><span data-type="text">We will check and inspect the quantity, color, size and other specifications of the goods. After the inspection is completed, the original express box will be removed, and the Pandabuy self-sealing bag will be used to pack the goods and arrange for storage. (Fragile, easy to break, express boxes are used as product packaging boxes, and there are oversized products, etc., and the original boxes are retained. The specific situation is subject to actual operation)</span></p>
<p style=""><span data-type="text">Notes:</span></p>
<p style=""><span data-type="text">a. Color difference, size error, use effect, etc. are not within the scope of inspection;</span></p>
<p style=""><span data-type="text">b. Electrical appliances, digital products, peripheral products and other highly professional products, their quality, model, spare parts, etc. are not within the scope of inspection;</span></p>
<p style=""><span data-type="text">c. "CD" and "hand-made" and "adult products" products, such sealed packaging and with sealing labels or sealing strips are inspected without unpacking. Only the appearance can be inspected for damage, and the details of the internal parts or functional problems cannot be specifically verified;</span></p>
<div><span style="font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;" data-type="text">What are the charges for purchasing services?</span></div>
<p style=""><span data-type="text">In addition to the cost of goods, international shipping and customs clearance fees, no other fees will be charged (please purchase value-added services on demand)</span></p>
<p style=""><span data-type="text">Total cost of purchasing on behalf of others = cost of goods + international shipping + additional services + customs clearance fees</span></p>
<p style=""><span data-type="text">Product cost: the selling price of the goods + shipping costs in mainland China (the shipping costs of goods from the seller's location to the HandHunt warehouse)</span></p>
<p style=""><span data-type="text">International shipping costs: the shipping costs calculated based on the weight of your goods, the selected shipping method, and the shipping area</span></p>
<p style=""><span data-type="text">Additional services:</span></p>
<p style=""><span data-type="text">Customs clearance fees: the cost of international customs clearance of the package, generally ￥8.00 (depending on the shipping method)</span></p>
<div><span style="font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;" data-type="text">Description of various statuses of HandHunt purchasing orders</span></div>
<h4  style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 85%; margin-top: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px; " id="All-statuses-of-domestic-orders-4" attr-anchor="1" ><span style="font-size: 12pt;" data-type="text">All statuses of domestic orders</span></h4>
<ol>
<li>
<div><span data-type="text">Waiting for payment</span></div>
<ol style="list-style-type: lower-alpha;">
<li><span data-type="text">The purchasing order has been generated and is waiting for payment. You need to complete the payment within 72 hours</span></li>
</ol>
</li>
<li>
<div><span data-type="text">Under review</span></div>
<ol style="list-style-type: lower-alpha;">
<li><span data-type="text">The order has been paid successfully and is waiting for the purchase order confirmation</span></li>
</ol>
</li>
<li>
<div><span data-type="text">Under processing</span></div>
<ol style="list-style-type: lower-alpha;">
<li><span data-type="text">The order has been assigned to the buyer for review and is ready to be ordered from the seller</span></li>
</ol>
</li>
<li>
<div><span data-type="text">Ordered</span></div>
<ol style="list-style-type: lower-alpha;">
<li><span data-type="text">The buyer has successfully ordered from the seller and is waiting for the seller to ship</span></li>
</ol>
</li>
<li>
<div><span data-type="text">Shipped</span></div>
<ol style="list-style-type: lower-alpha;">
<li><span data-type="text">The seller has shipped the goods and is waiting for the goods to arrive at the warehouse of XX platform</span></li>
</ol>
</li>
<li>
<div><span data-type="text">Received</span></div>
<ol style="list-style-type: lower-alpha;">
<li><span data-type="text">The goods have been delivered to the warehouse of XX platform for signature and are waiting for inspection</span></li>
</ol>
</li>
<li>
<div><span data-type="text">Inspected</span></div>
<ol style="list-style-type: lower-alpha;">
<li><span data-type="text">The goods have been inspected and weighed and are waiting for storage</span></li>
</ol>
</li>
<li>
<div><span data-type="text">Stored</span></div>
<ol style="list-style-type: lower-alpha;">
<li><span data-type="text">The goods have been stored in the warehouse of XX platform and can be submitted for shipment at any time during the free storage period of the goods</span></li>
</ol>
</li>
<li>
<div><span data-type="text">To be confirmed</span></div>
<ol style="list-style-type: lower-alpha;">
<li><span data-type="text">During the ordering process, we have information to confirm with you</span></li>
</ol>
</li>
<li>
<div><span data-type="text">Make-up payment</span></div>
<ol style="list-style-type: lower-alpha;">
<li><span data-type="text">The amount paid for the order is lower than the actual amount of the seller. The user needs to complete the make-up payment before the order can be placed normally</span></li>
</ol>
</li>
<li>
<div><span data-type="text">Partial refund</span></div>
<ol style="list-style-type: lower-alpha;">
<li><span data-type="text">The amount paid for the order is higher than the actual amount of the seller, and the refund amount is returned by the original route</span></li>
</ol>
</li>
<li>
<div><span data-type="text">Invalid order</span></div>
<ol style="list-style-type: lower-alpha;">
<li><span data-type="text">The name and price of the product are inconsistent with what you submitted, there is no picture or description of the actual product, virtual products, prohibited products, etc., are all considered invalid orders</span></li>
</ol>
</li>
<li>
<div><span data-type="text"> Returned order</span></div>
<ol style="list-style-type: lower-alpha;">
<li><span data-type="text">The user applies to cancel the order or returns the order due to reasons such as the seller or customs policy, and the product payment is automatically refunded to your payment account</span></li>
</ol>
</li>
<li>
<div><span data-type="text">Returning</span></div>
<ol style="list-style-type: lower-alpha;">
<li><span data-type="text">The platform has successfully negotiated a return with the seller, and the goods have been shipped to the seller, waiting for the seller to receive the goods and refund</span></li>
</ol>
</li>
<li>
<div><span data-type="text">Returned</span></div>
<ol style="list-style-type: lower-alpha;">
<li><span data-type="text">The return refund has been completed, and the return amount has been returned to the user's payment account</span></li>
</ol>
</li>
<li>
<div><span data-type="text">Exchange in progress</span></div>
<ol style="list-style-type: lower-alpha;">
<li><span data-type="text">The platform has successfully negotiated an exchange with the seller, and the exchange is being processed</span></li>
</ol>
</li>
<li>
<div><span data-type="text">Goods abnormality</span></div>
<ol style="list-style-type: lower-alpha;">
<li><span data-type="text">During the delivery process, other conditions such as lost items occurred</span></li>
</ol>
</li>
</ol>
<h4  style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 85%; margin-top: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px; " id="All-status-of-foreign-orders-4" attr-anchor="1" ><span style="font-size: 12pt;" data-type="text">All status of foreign orders</span></h4>
<ul>
<li>
<div><span data-type="text"> Already in stock</span></div>
<ul>
<li><span data-type="text">The goods have been stored in the warehouse of HandHunt platform and can be submitted for delivery at any time during the free storage period of the goods</span></li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>
<div><span data-type="text">Destroyed due to expiration</span></div>
<ul>
<li><span data-type="text">The goods have exceeded the storage period or you have voluntarily given up, the order status is set to "overdue" and the goods are destroyed</span></li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>
<div><span data-type="text"> Submit freight order</span></div>
<ul>
<li><span data-type="text">The user merges the package and submits the order, waiting for the background to set the package freight</span></li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>
<div><span data-type="text">International freight to be paid</span></div>
<ul>
<li><span data-type="text">The freight amount has been set in the background, waiting for the user to pay the package freight</span></li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>
<div><span data-type="text">To be shipped</span></div>
<ul>
<li><span data-type="text">The international package corresponding to this product has been paid successfully, waiting for the warehouse to pack and ship</span></li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>
<div><span data-type="text">International package has been shipped</span></div>
<ul>
<li><span data-type="text">The international package corresponding to this product has been shipped</span></li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>
<div><span data-type="text">Completed</span></div>
<ul>
<li><span data-type="text">You have received the product</span></li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>
<div><span data-type="text">Domestic return:</span></div>
<ul>
<li><span data-type="text">The package was returned due to domestic security inspection failure and other reasons, and has now been returned to our warehouse</span></li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>
<div><span data-type="text">Customs tax payment</span></div>
<ul>
<li><span data-type="text">After paying the customs tax, continue to send the package</span></li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>
<div><span data-type="text">Customs tax payment</span></div>
<ul>
<li><span data-type="text">Because the user did not pay the customs tax, it has now been returned to our warehouse</span></li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>
<div><span data-type="text">Overseas return:</span></div>
<ul>
<li><span data-type="text">After the package arrived abroad, it was returned due to customs security inspection failure or unsuccessful delivery, and has now been returned to our warehouse</span></li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>
<div><span data-type="text">Return to warehouse:</span></div>
<ul>
<li><span data-type="text">Return to warehouse due to domestic return/customs tax payment failure/overseas return</span></li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<div><span style="font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;" data-type="text">HandHunt's purchasing process</span><span style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; caret-color: #000000; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;">Selecting Products</span></div>
<h4  style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 13.6px; margin-top: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px; " id="Method-1-Copying-Product-Links-4" attr-anchor="1" ><span style="font-size: 12pt;" data-type="text">Method 1: Copying Product Links</span></h4>
<p style=""><span data-type="text">Users can first browse on Chinese shopping platforms (Taobao, Tmall, 1688, etc.), copy the link of the desired product, and paste it into the search box on the HandHunt page. The platform will automatically capture the product information.</span></p>
<h4  style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 13.6px; margin-top: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px; " id="span-stylefont-size-12pt-data-typetextimg-srchttpsstatic-globalzingfrontcomhandhuntblogshandhunt-8142de28png-alt-width1385-height935-span-4" attr-anchor="1" ><span style="font-size: 12pt;" data-type="text"><img src="https://static-global.zingfront.com/handhunt/blogs/handhunt-8142de28.png" alt="" width="1385" height="935" /></span></h4>
<h4  style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 13.6px; margin-top: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px; " id="Method-2-Searching-for-Products-4" attr-anchor="1" ><span style="font-size: 12pt;" data-type="text">Method 2: Searching for Products</span></h4>
<p style=""><span data-type="text">Users can search for products by name on the HandHunt platform and select from the results on Taobao, Tmall, and 1688.com.</span></p>
<p style=""><img src="https://static-global.zingfront.com/handhunt/blogs/handhunt-a564cd0d.png" alt="" width="1355" height="828" /></p>
<h4  style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 13.6px; margin-top: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px; " id="Tips-4" attr-anchor="1" ><span style="font-size: 12pt;" data-type="text">Tips</span></h4>
<ol style="caret-color: #000000;">
<li><span data-type="text">Currently, the platform is applicable to Taobao, Tmall, and 1688.</span></li>
<li><span data-type="text">Can't find the item? Try giving feedback to the customer service.</span></li>
</ol>
<div style="caret-color: #000000;"><span style="font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;" data-type="text">Placing Orders</span></div>
<p style=""><span data-type="text">Users can select the color, size, and quantity of the products. If there is any additional information they wish to convey to the seller (such as merchant discounts or seller contact information), they can leave a Tips in the remark section. To place an order immediately, users can select "Buy Now"; if they wish to browse more products and place orders later, they can select "Add to Cart."</span></p>
<p style=""><img src="https://static-global.zingfront.com/handhunt/blogs/handhunt-f0b0e5e8.png" alt="" /></p>
<h4  style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 13.6px; margin-top: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px; " id="Tips-4" attr-anchor="1" ><span style="font-size: 12pt;" data-type="text">Tips</span></h4>
<ol style="caret-color: #000000;">
<li><span data-type="text">Please note that due to certain items being restricted for international shipping, there will be risk reminders.</span></li>
<li><span data-type="text">Most products on 1688 have a minimum order quantity. Please refer to the supplier's minimum quantity order.</span></li>
</ol>
<div style="caret-color: #000000;"><span style="font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;" data-type="text">Confirming Orders</span></div>
<p style=""><span data-type="text">If the user selects "Buy Now" in the previous step or clicks "Checkout" after selecting products in the "Cart" page, they will be redirected to this page where they can reconfirm the order details and select the final delivery country.</span></p>
<p style=""><img src="https://static-global.zingfront.com/handhunt/blogs/handhunt-1ea0409c.png" alt="" width="1384" height="776" /></p>
<div style="caret-color: #000000;"><span style="font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;" data-type="text">Paying for Orders</span></div>
<p style=""><span data-type="text">After submitting the order, users will be redirected to the checkout page where they can choose a payment method to complete the payment. Payment options include PayPal, credit cards, WeChat Pay, Alipay, Chinese debit cards, and bank wire transfers.</span></p>
<p style=""><span data-type="text"><img src="https://static-global.zingfront.com/handhunt/blogs/handhunt-5fa44370.png" alt="" width="938" height="696" /></span></p>
<h4  style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 13.6px; margin-top: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px; " id="Tips-4" attr-anchor="1" ><span style="font-size: 12pt;" data-type="text">Tips</span></h4>
<p style=""><span data-type="text">● Supports multiple currencies</span><br data-path="22,1" /><span data-type="text">● Payment methods: PayPal, credit card, WeChat Pay, Alipay, Chinese debit card, bank wire transfer.</span></p>
<div style="caret-color: #000000;"><span style="font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;" data-type="text">HandHunt Platform Purchase</span></div>
<p style=""><span data-type="text">HandHunt will contact the seller and purchase the ordered items on the user's behalf.</span></p>
<p style=""><img src="https://static-global.zingfront.com/handhunt/blogs/handhunt-c11e5c17.png" alt="" width="938" height="696" /></p>
<h4  style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 13.6px; margin-top: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px; " id="Tips-4" attr-anchor="1" ><span style="font-size: 12pt;" data-type="text">Tips</span></h4>
<p style=""><span data-type="text">During the purchase process, you can contact our customer service for any further details. We will contact you via email or message if needed.</span></p>
<div style="caret-color: #000000;"><span style="font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;" data-type="text">Inspection and Storage</span></div>
<p style=""><span data-type="text">Quality inspections will be conducted, and the items will be stored in the warehouse. Users can verify the inspection information by selecting "Inspected" under the "My Orders" section and clicking "View Inspection Photos."</span></p>
<p style=""><img src="https://static-global.zingfront.com/handhunt/blogs/handhunt-a5879e21.png" alt="" width="1079" height="675" /></p>
<h4  style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 13.6px; margin-top: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px; " id="Tips-4" attr-anchor="1" ><span style="font-size: 12pt;" data-type="text">Tips:</span></h4>
<ol style="caret-color: #000000;">
<li><span data-type="text">After the items arrive at our warehouse, they will undergo a series of quality checks, and photos will be taken for your reference. If you have any questions within 24 hours after we confirm their correctness, please contact us immediately.</span></li>
<li><span data-type="text">Products purchased from 1688 have a different set of quality control standards.</span></li>
</ol>
<div style="caret-color: #000000;"><span style="font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;" data-type="text">Submitting Orders from the Warehouse</span></div>
<p style=""><span data-type="text">From the "My Warehouse" section, select "In Stock," check the items, fill in the shipping details, and submit the order.</span></p>
<p style=""><span data-type="text">HandHunt offers additional services such as package removal, reinforcement, and insurance. Please inform us of any such requirements.</span></p>
<p style=""> </p>
<h4  style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 13.6px; margin-top: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px; " id="Tips-4" attr-anchor="1" ><span style="font-size: 12pt;" data-type="text">Tips:</span></h4>
<p style=""><span data-type="text">We offer additional services such as package removal, package reinforcement, insurance, etc. Please let us know and we will follow your requirements.</span></p>
<div style="caret-color: #000000;"><span style="font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;" data-type="text">Paying for International Shipping</span></div>
<p style=""><span data-type="text">Select "Pending Payment" from the "My Warehouse" section to pay for the international shipping fees.</span></p>
<p style=""><img src="https://static-global.zingfront.com/handhunt/blogs/handhunt-d1d25772.png" alt="" width="1287" height="718" /></p>
<h4  style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 13.6px; margin-top: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px; " id="Tips-4" attr-anchor="1" ><span style="font-size: 12pt;" data-type="text">Tips</span></h4>
<p style=""><span data-type="text">The international shipping deposit is calculated based on the estimated weight of the product, the selected shipping method, and the destination. The final shipping fee will be based on the package's actual size and weight verified by the shipping company. Any difference between the final fee and the deposit will be refunded to the user's payment account after the product is shipped.</span></p>
<div style="caret-color: #000000;"><span style="font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;" data-type="text">Awaiting Shipment</span></div>
<p style=""><span data-type="text">In the "Awaiting Shipment" section of "My Warehouse," items will be consolidated, packaged, reinforced, weighed, and shipped. An international tracking number will be generated accordingly.</span></p>
<h4  style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 13.6px; margin-top: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px; " id="Tips-4" attr-anchor="1" ><span style="font-size: 12pt;" data-type="text">Tips</span></h4>
<p style=""><span data-type="text">There may be cases of domestic returns due to customs issues such as additional taxes. In such cases, users may be required to pay the additional taxes. If the package is returned to the warehouse due to non-payment of taxes or for safety reasons, and the user still wishes to resend it, they need to handle the matter accordingly in the "My Package" section.</span></p>
<div style="caret-color: #000000;"><span style="font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;" data-type="text">Shipped</span></div>
<p style=""><span style="background-color: #fdfdfe;" data-type="text">You can check the international logistics status and track the shipping progress of your package under the "Shipped" section in "My Warehouse."</span></p>
<h4  style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 13.6px; margin-top: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px; " id="Tips-4" attr-anchor="1" ><span style="font-size: 12pt;" data-type="text">Tips</span></h4>
<p style=""><span style="background-color: #fdfdfe;" data-type="text">During international package transportation, accidents can always occur. Such situations include delays, confiscation, taxes, package damage, package loss, etc. The HandHunt platform cannot control or prevent accidents that may occur when your package is in the hands of third-party logistics companies or customs. We also cannot guarantee the service quality of other companies unrelated to the HandHunt platform. However, our goal is to provide the best service to our customers, and we will notify you ahead of time about the shipping conditions for each route or country you choose, and do our best to assist you when problems arise.</span></p>
<p style=""><span style="background-color: #fdfdfe;" data-type="text">If the package is returned to the warehouse due to reasons such as failed delivery, you need to split the package in "My Packages" if you still want to resend it.</span></p>
<div style="caret-color: #000000;"><span style="font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;" data-type="text">Delivered</span></div>
<p style=""><span style="background-color: #fdfdfe;" data-type="text">The package has been successfully delivered to you. If you have any questions about the package, you can select the relevant package and add after-sales service Tipss.</span></p>
<p style=""><img src="https://static-global.zingfront.com/handhunt/blogs/handhunt-1a4a5252.png" alt="" width="1586" height="732" /></p>
<h4  style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 13.6px; margin-top: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px; " id="Tips-4" attr-anchor="1" ><span data-type="text">Tips</span></h4>
<p style=""><span style="background-color: #fdfdfe;" data-type="text">We determine whether a product has been delivered based on the logistics delivery to your hands. If you have any disputes with the order, please feel free to contact our customer service team, and we will do our best to assist you.</span></p>
<div><span style="font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;" data-type="text">Reference table for intact product packaging standards</span></div>
<p style=""><span data-type="text">The packaging of some products on the platform needs to refer to the table below. If it does not meet the requirements, the unconditional return and exchange rules (table) cannot be used.</span></p>
<table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 569px;"><colgroup><col width="225" /><col width="344" /></colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="overflow: hidden; padding: 4px 8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: bottom; padding-left: 7px; padding-right: 7px; border: 1px solid #808080;" colspan="1" rowspan="1">
<p style=""><span style="font-weight: bold;" data-type="text">Category name</span></p>
</td>
<td style="overflow: hidden; padding: 4px 8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: bottom; padding-left: 7px; padding-right: 7px; border: 1px solid #808080;" colspan="1" rowspan="1">
<p style=""><span style="font-weight: bold;" data-type="text">Special integrity standard</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="overflow: hidden; padding: 4px 8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: bottom; padding-left: 7px; padding-right: 7px; border: 1px solid #808080;" colspan="1" rowspan="1">
<p style=""><span data-type="text">Sports shoes</span></p>
</td>
<td style="overflow: hidden; padding: 4px 8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: bottom; padding-left: 7px; padding-right: 7px; border: 1px solid #808080;" colspan="1" rowspan="1">
<p style=""><span data-type="text">(If any) anti-theft buckles and anti-damage stickers cannot be cut or torn off; and reasonable use shall not be affected</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="overflow: hidden; padding: 4px 8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: bottom; padding-left: 7px; padding-right: 7px; border: 1px solid #808080;" colspan="1" rowspan="1">
<p style=""><span data-type="text">Cleansers/Sanitary napkins/Paper/Aromatherapy</span></p>
</td>
<td style="overflow: hidden; padding: 4px 8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: bottom; padding-left: 7px; padding-right: 7px; border: 1px solid #808080;" colspan="1" rowspan="1">
<p style=""><span data-type="text">The disposable sealed packaging of washing and care products (if any) has not been opened;</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="overflow: hidden; padding: 4px 8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: bottom; padding-left: 7px; padding-right: 7px; border: 1px solid #808080;" colspan="1" rowspan="1">
<p style=""><span data-type="text">Hairdressing/Wigs</span></p>
</td>
<td style="overflow: hidden; padding: 4px 8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: bottom; padding-left: 7px; padding-right: 7px; border: 1px solid #808080;" colspan="1" rowspan="1">
<p style=""><span data-type="text">The disposable sealed packaging of hair care products (if any) has not been opened;</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="overflow: hidden; padding: 4px 8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: bottom; padding-left: 7px; padding-right: 7px; border: 1px solid #808080;" colspan="1" rowspan="1">
<p style=""><span data-type="text">Beauty/Body/Essential oils</span></p>
</td>
<td style="overflow: hidden; padding: 4px 8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: bottom; padding-left: 7px; padding-right: 7px; border: 1px solid #808080;" colspan="1" rowspan="1">
<p style=""><span data-type="text">(If any) The disposable sealed packaging of the products has not been opened;</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="overflow: hidden; padding: 4px 8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: bottom; padding-left: 7px; padding-right: 7px; border: 1px solid #808080;" colspan="1" rowspan="1">
<p style=""><span data-type="text">Cosmetics/Perfumes/Beauty tools</span></p>
</td>
<td style="overflow: hidden; padding: 4px 8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: bottom; padding-left: 7px; padding-right: 7px; border: 1px solid #808080;" colspan="1" rowspan="1">
<p style=""><span data-type="text">(If any) The disposable sealed packaging of the products has not been opened;</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="overflow: hidden; padding: 4px 8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: bottom; padding-left: 7px; padding-right: 7px; border: 1px solid #808080;" colspan="1" rowspan="1">
<p style=""><span data-type="text">Digital home appliance industry (except cameras and large appliances)</span></p>
</td>
<td style="overflow: hidden; padding: 4px 8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: bottom; padding-left: 7px; padding-right: 7px; border: 1px solid #808080;" colspan="1" rowspan="1">
<p style=""><span data-type="text">1. The network access license is not damaged (destroyed); 2. No immersion;</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="overflow: hidden; padding: 4px 8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: bottom; padding-left: 7px; padding-right: 7px; border: 1px solid #808080;" colspan="1" rowspan="1">
<p style=""><span data-type="text">Digital cameras/SLR cameras/Camcorders</span></p>
</td>
<td style="overflow: hidden; padding: 4px 8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: bottom; padding-left: 7px; padding-right: 7px; border: 1px solid #808080;" colspan="1" rowspan="1">
<p style=""><span data-type="text">The shutter of SLR camera products shall not be used more than 20 times;</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="overflow: hidden; padding: 4px 8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: bottom; padding-left: 7px; padding-right: 7px; border: 1px solid #808080;" colspan="1" rowspan="1">
<p style=""><span data-type="text">Major appliances</span></p>
</td>
<td style="overflow: hidden; padding: 4px 8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: bottom; padding-left: 7px; padding-right: 7px; border: 1px solid #808080;" colspan="1" rowspan="1">
<p style=""><span data-type="text">1. LCD TVs and air conditioners are allowed to be simply powered on and debugged, and they shall not be installed on the wall; </span></p>
<p style=""><span data-type="text">2. Washing machines shall not be used in water;</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="overflow: hidden; padding: 4px 8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: bottom; padding-left: 7px; padding-right: 7px; border: 1px solid #808080;" colspan="1" rowspan="1">
<p style=""><span data-type="text">Model toys/animation/peripherals/COS/board games</span></p>
</td>
<td style="overflow: hidden; padding: 4px 8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: bottom; padding-left: 7px; padding-right: 7px; border: 1px solid #808080;" colspan="1" rowspan="1">
<p style=""><span data-type="text">The inner packaging (if any) of models, figures, soldiers, and BJD products cannot be removed;</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="overflow: hidden; padding: 4px 8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: bottom; padding-left: 7px; padding-right: 7px; border: 1px solid #808080;" colspan="1" rowspan="1">
<p style=""><span data-type="text">Electronic components</span></p>
</td>
<td style="overflow: hidden; padding: 4px 8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: bottom; padding-left: 7px; padding-right: 7px; border: 1px solid #808080;" colspan="1" rowspan="1">
<p style=""><span data-type="text">1. No welding operation has been performed; </span></p>
<p style=""><span data-type="text">2. The integrated circuit is not installed on the IC base; </span></p>
<p style=""><span data-type="text">3. The disposable sealed packaging of consumables (thermal silicone grease/thermal paste, electronic glue/potting glue/sealant/adhesive, conductive glue, conductive ink) has not been opened;</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="overflow: hidden; padding: 4px 8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: bottom; padding-left: 7px; padding-right: 7px; border: 1px solid #808080;" colspan="1" rowspan="1">
<p style=""><span data-type="text">Secondary category "Game software" under the first-level category "Video games/Accessories/Games/Strategies"</span></p>
</td>
<td style="overflow: hidden; padding: 4px 8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: bottom; padding-left: 7px; padding-right: 7px; border: 1px solid #808080;" colspan="1" rowspan="1">
<p style=""><span data-type="text">(If any) the disposable sealed packaging of the product outer packaging has not been opened;</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="overflow: hidden; padding: 4px 8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: bottom; padding-left: 7px; padding-right: 7px; border: 1px solid #808080;" colspan="1" rowspan="1">
<p style=""><span data-type="text">Pet food, health products and medicines under the first-level category "Pets/Pet food and supplies"</span></p>
</td>
<td style="overflow: hidden; padding: 4px 8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: bottom; padding-left: 7px; padding-right: 7px; border: 1px solid #808080;" colspan="1" rowspan="1">
<p style=""><span data-type="text">(If any) the disposable sealed packaging of the product outer packaging has not been opened;</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="overflow: hidden; padding: 4px 8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: bottom; padding-left: 7px; padding-right: 7px; border: 1px solid #808080;" colspan="1" rowspan="1">
<p style=""><span data-type="text">Books/Magazines/Books</span></p>
</td>
<td style="overflow: hidden; padding: 4px 8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: bottom; padding-left: 7px; padding-right: 7px; border: 1px solid #808080;" colspan="1" rowspan="1">
<p style=""><span data-type="text">1. (If any) the disposable sealed packaging of the product has not been opened; </span></p>
<p style=""><span data-type="text">2. The product has no creases, water stains, stains, handwriting, or reading marks;</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="overflow: hidden; padding: 4px 8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: bottom; padding-left: 7px; padding-right: 7px; border: 1px solid #808080;" colspan="1" rowspan="1">
<p style=""><span data-type="text">Secondary categories "Feed" and "Animal health products/Veterinary drugs" under the first-level category "Animal husbandry/Aquaculture materials"</span></p>
</td>
<td style="overflow: hidden; padding: 4px 8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: bottom; padding-left: 7px; padding-right: 7px; border: 1px solid #808080;" colspan="1" rowspan="1">
<p style=""><span data-type="text">(If any) the disposable sealed packaging of the product has not been opened;</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="overflow: hidden; padding: 4px 8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: bottom; padding-left: 7px; padding-right: 7px; border: 1px solid #808080;" colspan="2" rowspan="1">
<p style=""><span data-type="text">The outer packaging of food (including health food), cosmetics, medical devices, family planning products, personal care products, adult products, baby diapers, books, and audio-visual products is sealed once and for all and shall not be unsealed.</span></p>
<p style=""><span data-type="text">"Sealed" means: the outer packaging of the product is sealed (signed) or plastic (sealed) by the manufacturer.</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<div><span style="font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;" data-type="text">What you need to know when purchasing HandHunt</span></div>
<h4  style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 85%; margin-top: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px; " id="HandHunt-a-bridge-between-Eastern-and-Western-creativity-4" attr-anchor="1" ><span style="font-size: 12pt;" data-type="text">HandHunt: a bridge between Eastern and Western creativity</span></h4>
<p style=""><span data-type="text">Our purchasing platform is committed to providing customers with a diversified product selection similar to Etsy. Not only does the product range fully cover Etsy's various specialty products, it also has a significant advantage in price. We know that many sellers on Etsy will choose to find a stable supply chain in the Chinese market in order to pursue higher cost performance, and 1688 is one of their often chosen purchase channels.</span></p>
<p style=""><span data-type="text">However, unlike purchasing directly from 1688 or other Chinese e-commerce platforms, our purchasing agent platform has the following core advantages:</span></p>
<h5 style="font-size: 11pt; line-height: 85%; margin-top: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px; "><span style="font-size: 11pt;" data-type="text">1. Professional screening and quality assurance</span></h5>
<p style=""><span data-type="text">We have a professional purchasing team that conducts strict screening and quality control on every product to ensure that the products sold meet the quality standards of the international market, so that customers do not need to worry about quality issues.</span></p>
<h5 style="font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.45; "><span style="font-size: 11pt;" data-type="text">2. One-stop purchasing service</span></h5>
<p style=""><span data-type="text">Whether you find your favorite product on Taobao, 1688 or other Chinese e-commerce platforms, just provide us with the link, and our team will respond quickly to purchase and ship, providing you with a convenient one-stop service. .</span></p>
<h5 style="font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.45; "><span style="font-size: 11pt;" data-type="text">3. Price advantage</span></h5>
<p style=""><span data-type="text">With our in-depth understanding of the Chinese market and rich procurement experience, we are able to provide customers with more competitive prices, making your procurement costs lower and your profits higher.</span></p>
<h5 style="font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.45; "><span style="font-size: 11pt;" data-type="text">4. Efficient logistics system</span></h5>
<p style=""><span data-type="text">We have a complete logistics system that can quickly and accurately complete the packaging and delivery of goods, ensuring that goods can be delivered to customers safely and timely.</span></p>
<h5 style="font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.45; "><span style="font-size: 11pt;" data-type="text">5. Customer Service and Support</span></h5>
<p style=""><span data-type="text">We value every customer's needs and feedback and provide a full range of customer service and support to ensure that you enjoy a worry-free shopping experience during the purchasing process.</span></p>
<p style=""><span data-type="text">All in all, Etsy has won the love of consumers around the world for its unique products and personalized shopping experience. HandHunt, on the other hand, brings more choices and benefits to consumers by providing similar products to Etsy at better prices.</span></p>
<h4  style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 85%; margin-top: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px; " id="Order-processing-service-standards-4" attr-anchor="1" ><span style="font-size: 12pt;" data-type="text">Order processing service standards</span></h4>
<table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 736px;"><colgroup><col width="162" /><col width="162" /><col width="412" /></colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="overflow: hidden; padding: 4px 8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: middle; padding-left: 7px; padding-right: 7px; border: 1px solid #808080;" colspan="1" rowspan="1">
<p style="text-align: center; "><span style="font-weight: bold;" data-type="text">Service links</span></p>
</td>
<td style="overflow: hidden; padding: 4px 8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: middle; padding-left: 7px; padding-right: 7px; border: 1px solid #808080;" colspan="1" rowspan="1">
<p style="text-align: center; "><span style="font-weight: bold;" data-type="text">Service items</span></p>
</td>
<td style="overflow: hidden; padding: 4px 8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: middle; padding-left: 7px; padding-right: 7px; border: 1px solid #808080;" colspan="1" rowspan="1">
<p style="text-align: center; "><span style="font-weight: bold;" data-type="text">Service standards</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="overflow: hidden; padding: 4px 8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: top; padding-left: 7px; padding-right: 7px; border: 1px solid #808080;" colspan="1" rowspan="3">
<p style="text-align: center; "><span data-type="text">Order purchase</span></p>
</td>
<td style="overflow: hidden; padding: 4px 8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: top; padding-left: 7px; padding-right: 7px; border: 1px solid #808080;" colspan="1" rowspan="1">
<p style="text-align: center; "><span data-type="text">Order response time limit</span></p>
</td>
<td style="overflow: hidden; padding: 4px 8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: top; padding-left: 7px; padding-right: 7px; border: 1px solid #808080;" colspan="1" rowspan="1">
<p style=""><span data-type="text">1) Purchase orders submitted between 09:00-18:00 Beijing time will be responded to within 6 hours. 2) Purchase orders submitted between 18:00-09:00 Beijing time will be processed before 14:00 the next day. 3) For orders that have been confirmed or repaid by the user, the buyer will complete the order within 24 hours.</span></p>
<p style=""> </p>
<p style=""><span data-type="text">Note: If the user has special needs to confirm with the seller, and the seller has not been online, the validity period will be extended accordingly.</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="overflow: hidden; padding: 4px 8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: top; padding-left: 7px; padding-right: 7px; border: 1px solid #808080;" colspan="1" rowspan="1">
<p style="text-align: center; "><span data-type="text">Order payment</span></p>
</td>
<td style="overflow: hidden; padding: 4px 8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: top; padding-left: 7px; padding-right: 7px; border: 1px solid #808080;" colspan="1" rowspan="1">
<p style=""><span data-type="text">When the price of the product or shipping fee is inconsistent with the user's submission, the buyer will immediately set the reimbursement according to the actual value of the product.</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="overflow: hidden; padding: 4px 8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: top; padding-left: 7px; padding-right: 7px; border: 1px solid #808080;" colspan="1" rowspan="1">
<p style="text-align: center; "><span data-type="text">Order cancellation and return</span></p>
</td>
<td style="overflow: hidden; padding: 4px 8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: top; padding-left: 7px; padding-right: 7px; border: 1px solid #808080;" colspan="1" rowspan="1">
<p style=""><span data-type="text">The user applies to cancel the "under review" order, and the buyer will process the cancellation order within 24 hours and refund the user's product payment.</span></p>
<p style=""><span data-type="text">If the user's product is identified as a virtual item, contraband, etc., the order is invalid, the product amount will be returned to the user's account, and the transaction is over.</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="overflow: hidden; padding: 4px 8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: top; padding-left: 7px; padding-right: 7px; border: 1px solid #808080;" colspan="1" rowspan="4">
<p style="text-align: center; "><span data-type="text">Order delivery</span></p>
</td>
<td style="overflow: hidden; padding: 4px 8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: top; padding-left: 7px; padding-right: 7px; border: 1px solid #808080;" colspan="1" rowspan="1">
<p style="text-align: center; "><span data-type="text">Actively follow up with sellers to ship</span></p>
</td>
<td style="overflow: hidden; padding: 4px 8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: top; padding-left: 7px; padding-right: 7px; border: 1px solid #808080;" colspan="1" rowspan="1">
<p style=""><span data-type="text">Domestic sellers generally ship within 3 to 7 days, subject to the actual situation of the seller. For orders that have not been shipped for more than 3 days, the buyer will follow up for the first time on the 4th day, and then follow up every 3-4 days. If the seller does not ship or reply to the message, the buyer will communicate with the platform and eventually refund the order to the user.</span></p>
<p style=""> </p>
<p style=""><span data-type="text">Note: Pre-sale/deposit orders are excluded</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="overflow: hidden; padding: 4px 8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: top; padding-left: 7px; padding-right: 7px; border: 1px solid #808080;" colspan="1" rowspan="1">
<p style="text-align: center; "><span data-type="text">Users urge shipment</span></p>
</td>
<td style="overflow: hidden; padding: 4px 8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: top; padding-left: 7px; padding-right: 7px; border: 1px solid #808080;" colspan="1" rowspan="1">
<p style=""><span data-type="text">For orders where the user clicks on urging delivery, the buyer will verify the delivery time within 24 hours and notify the user; if the seller does not reply, the information will be synchronized to the user according to the actual situation.</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="overflow: hidden; padding: 4px 8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: top; padding-left: 7px; padding-right: 7px; border: 1px solid #808080;" colspan="1" rowspan="1">
<p style="text-align: center; "><span data-type="text">Out-of-stock return</span></p>
</td>
<td style="overflow: hidden; padding: 4px 8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: top; padding-left: 7px; padding-right: 7px; border: 1px solid #808080;" colspan="1" rowspan="1">
<p style=""><span data-type="text">If the seller informs that the product is out of stock, the buyer will synchronize the out-of-stock information to the user. If the user does not reply within 72 hours, the order will be refunded for the user.</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="overflow: hidden; padding: 4px 8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: top; padding-left: 7px; padding-right: 7px; border: 1px solid #808080;" colspan="1" rowspan="1">
<p style="text-align: center; "><span data-type="text">Return or exchange of inspected goods due to quality reasons</span></p>
</td>
<td style="overflow: hidden; padding: 4px 8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: top; padding-left: 7px; padding-right: 7px; border: 1px solid #808080;" colspan="1" rowspan="1">
<p style=""><span data-type="text">For orders of inspected goods, due to quality problems, the user applies for return or exchange. The buyer will verify with the seller within 24 hours and accept or respond to the return or exchange according to the actual situation.</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="overflow: hidden; padding: 4px 8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: top; padding-left: 7px; padding-right: 7px; border: 1px solid #808080;" colspan="1" rowspan="7">
<p style="text-align: center; "><span data-type="text">Order after-sales</span></p>
</td>
<td style="overflow: hidden; padding: 4px 8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: top; padding-left: 7px; padding-right: 7px; border: 1px solid #808080;" colspan="1" rowspan="1">
<p style="text-align: center; "><span data-type="text">Order consultation</span></p>
</td>
<td style="overflow: hidden; padding: 4px 8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: top; padding-left: 7px; padding-right: 7px; border: 1px solid #808080;" colspan="1" rowspan="1">
<p style=""><span data-type="text">The buyer will respond and reply to the order consultation initiated by the user within 24 hours.</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="overflow: hidden; padding: 4px 8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: top; padding-left: 7px; padding-right: 7px; border: 1px solid #808080;" colspan="1" rowspan="1">
<p style="text-align: center; "><span data-type="text">Reply to internal messages</span></p>
</td>
<td style="overflow: hidden; padding: 4px 8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: top; padding-left: 7px; padding-right: 7px; border: 1px solid #808080;" colspan="1" rowspan="1">
<p style=""><span data-type="text">The buyer will respond and reply to the in-site message replied by the user within 24 hours.</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="overflow: hidden; padding: 4px 8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: top; padding-left: 7px; padding-right: 7px; border: 1px solid #808080;" colspan="1" rowspan="1">
<p style="text-align: center; "><span data-type="text">Refund time limit</span></p>
</td>
<td style="overflow: hidden; padding: 4px 8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: top; padding-left: 7px; padding-right: 7px; border: 1px solid #808080;" colspan="1" rowspan="1">
<p style=""><span data-type="text">The buyer will refund the user after receiving the refund within 4-10 days; in special circumstances, the buyer will verify the situation and synchronize the information to the user.</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="overflow: hidden; padding: 4px 8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: top; padding-left: 7px; padding-right: 7px; border: 1px solid #808080;" colspan="1" rowspan="1">
<p style="text-align: center; "><span data-type="text">Product quality inspection</span></p>
</td>
<td style="overflow: hidden; padding: 4px 8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: top; padding-left: 7px; padding-right: 7px; border: 1px solid #808080;" colspan="1" rowspan="1">
<p style=""><span data-type="text">If there are quality inspection problems with the product or the user points out the product defects, the buyer needs to verify with the seller and assist the user in communicating and negotiating with the seller.</span></p>
<p style=""> </p>
<p style=""><span data-type="text">Related content: Common types of product defects/quality issues and dispute resolution methods</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="overflow: hidden; padding: 4px 8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: top; padding-left: 7px; padding-right: 7px; border: 1px solid #808080;" colspan="1" rowspan="1">
<p style="text-align: center; "><span data-type="text">Return time limit</span></p>
</td>
<td style="overflow: hidden; padding: 4px 8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: top; padding-left: 7px; padding-right: 7px; border: 1px solid #808080;" colspan="1" rowspan="1">
<p style=""><span data-type="text">When inspecting the goods, the buyer will negotiate with the seller within 48 hours to confirm whether the goods can be returned based on whether the goods have quality problems. In special circumstances, the buyer will verify the situation and synchronize the information to the user.</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="overflow: hidden; padding: 4px 8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: top; padding-left: 7px; padding-right: 7px; border: 1px solid #808080;" colspan="1" rowspan="1">
<p style="text-align: center; "><span data-type="text">Exchange time limit</span></p>
</td>
<td style="overflow: hidden; padding: 4px 8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: top; padding-left: 7px; padding-right: 7px; border: 1px solid #808080;" colspan="1" rowspan="1">
<p style=""><span data-type="text">When inspecting the goods, the buyer will negotiate with the seller within 48 hours to confirm whether the goods can be exchanged based on whether the goods have quality problems. In special circumstances, the buyer will verify the situation and synchronize the information to the user.</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="overflow: hidden; padding: 4px 8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: top; padding-left: 7px; padding-right: 7px; border: 1px solid #808080;" colspan="1" rowspan="1">
<p style="text-align: center; "><span data-type="text">International package after-sales service</span></p>
</td>
<td style="overflow: hidden; padding: 4px 8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; vertical-align: top; padding-left: 7px; padding-right: 7px; border: 1px solid #808080;" colspan="1" rowspan="1">
<p style=""><span data-type="text">If the user applies for after-sales service for the package regarding the product problem, if the buyer needs to contact the seller, the buyer will verify with the seller for the user free of charge and synchronize the verification information to the after-sales customer service.</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<h4  style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 85%; margin-top: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px; " id="Third-party-buyer-company-entry-and-disclaimer-4" attr-anchor="1" ><span style="font-size: 12pt;" data-type="text">Third-party buyer company entry and disclaimer</span></h4>
<p style=""><span data-type="text">HandHunt purchasing order business is undertaken by high-quality third-party buyer companies. Buyers receive platform training and supervision, provide order purchasing services to HandHunt users according to order processing service standards, provide users with related procurement, domestic after-sales and other services, and accept user supervision. If you have any objections to the services provided by buyers, please contact Pandabuy online customer service for assistance. All purchasing products displayed in the HandHunt purchasing module and search products are not products sold by HandHunt, but are products of third-party shopping platforms. Therefore, HandHunt and third-party buyers are not responsible for obligations and responsibilities related to related products, including but not limited to copyright or intellectual property infringement, and do not bear any legal liability or joint and several liability.</span></p>
<div><span style="font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;" data-type="text">Can my HandHunt purchasing order be canceled or returned for refund?</span></div>
<p style=""><span data-type="text">1. "Under review" status You can click "Cancel order" on the corresponding order on the User Center-Purchasing order page, and the product amount will be returned to your account in the original way, and the transaction is completed</span></p>
<p style=""><span data-type="text">2. "Inspected" status, if there is a product quality problem, you can inform the online customer service that you need to exchange or return the product. The buyer will apply for a refund from the seller. After the seller confirms the refund, the corresponding amount will be returned to your account by the original route. It usually takes 3-5 days.</span></p>
</article></div></div><!--]--></div><div class="hh-col hh-col-5 is-guttered blog-side" style="padding-right:10px;padding-left:10px;" data-v-5a9e72da><!--[--><div class="other-lang-wrap flex" data-v-5a9e72da><div class="label" data-v-5a9e72da>Blog Language: </div><span data-v-5a9e72da></span></div><div class="blog-side-toc blog-side-item" data-v-5a9e72da><div class="blog-side-toc-title" data-v-5a9e72da>Outline:</div><div class="blog-outline-list" data-v-5a9e72da><!--[--><div class="blog-outline-node" data-v-5a9e72da data-v-a6069a1a><a title="How long will it take for the merchant to ship the ordered goods?" href="#How-long-will-it-take-for-the-merchant-to-ship-the-ordered-goods-2" class="anchor-tag h2" data-v-a6069a1a>How long will it take for the merchant to ship the ordered goods?</a><!----></div><div class="blog-outline-node" data-v-5a9e72da data-v-a6069a1a><a title="How long will it take for the shipped goods to be delivered to HandHunt?" href="#How-long-will-it-take-for-the-shipped-goods-to-be-delivered-to-HandHunt-2" class="anchor-tag h2" data-v-a6069a1a>How long will it take for the shipped goods to be delivered to HandHunt?</a><!----></div><div class="blog-outline-node" data-v-5a9e72da data-v-a6069a1a><a title="Purchasing Disclaimer" href="#Purchasing-Disclaimer-2" class="anchor-tag h2" data-v-a6069a1a>Purchasing Disclaimer</a><div class="children" data-v-a6069a1a><!--[--><div class="blog-outline-node" data-v-a6069a1a data-v-a6069a1a><a title="1. Sensitive goods:" href="#Sensitive-goods1-4" class="anchor-tag h4" data-v-a6069a1a>1. Sensitive goods:</a><!----></div><div class="blog-outline-node" data-v-a6069a1a data-v-a6069a1a><a title="2. Customs policy:" href="#Customs-policy2-4" class="anchor-tag h4" data-v-a6069a1a>2. Customs policy:</a><!----></div><div class="blog-outline-node" data-v-a6069a1a data-v-a6069a1a><a title="3. Unable to professionally inspect goods:" href="#Unable-to-professionally-inspect-goods3-4" class="anchor-tag h4" data-v-a6069a1a>3. Una