ds Overseas?","Freight forwarders handle international shipping for consignors, advising on packaging, selecting optimal routes, arranging customs clearance, and consolidating goods. They ensure consignors access efficient transportation solutions.","Freight Forwarder, Consignor, Consignor access, select route","https://static-global.zingfront.com/handhunt/blogs/handhunt-7d6e5441.jpeg",1721874511,1718968138,{"cn":294},"/blogs/how-to-ship-goods-overseas-cn",{"id":296,"uri":294,"category_id":297,"title":298,"description":299,"keywords":300,"lang":175,"head_image":301,"updated_at":302,"created_at":303,"other_lang":304},24,3,"商品怎样寄出到海外？","介绍了商品寄往海外的多种方式，特别是国际货运代理和国际四大快递的优缺点。货代公司通过集中发货享受价格优惠，简化流程，提高效率，成为跨境电商和外贸商发货的首选。","国际货运代理、四大快递、货代优势、集中发货、价格优惠、流程简便。","https://static-global.zingfront.com/handhunt/blogs/handhunt-3c4de6a4.jpeg",1721874516,1718968448,{"en":285},{"id":306,"uri":307,"category_id":297,"title":308,"description":309,"keywords":310,"lang":175,"head_image":311,"updated_at":312,"created_at":313,"other_lang":314},25,"/blogs/what-is-taobao-cn","什么是淘宝？","淘宝是阿里巴巴集团旗下的电商平台，以商品多样性、价格优势、交易安全和物流服务完善著称。通过直播带货、社区互动等创新方式，为消费者提供丰富多样的购物选择和愉快的购物体验。","天猫， 淘宝美国， 淘宝中国， 直播， 购物 中心","https://static-global.zingfront.com/handhunt/blogs/handhunt-b65fe076.png",1721904613,1718968488,{"en":315},"/blogs/what-is-taobao",{"id":317,"uri":318,"category_id":173,"title":319,"description":320,"keywords":321,"lang":175,"head_image":322,"updated_at":323,"created_at":324,"other_lang":325},26,"/manual/what-is-consolidation-shipping-service-cn","什么是集运服务？","主要介绍了集运服务的概念、特点及其与转运、货运的区别，并详细描述了集运服务的流程，展示了其便捷、高效的服务模式。","集运服务、转运、货运、流程、特点","https://static-global.zingfront.com/handhunt/blogs/handhunt-b1b5d875.png",1728963368,1718968626,{"en":326},"/manual/what-is-consolidation-shipping-service",{"id":328,"uri":326,"category_id":157,"title":329,"description":330,"keywords":331,"lang":161,"head_image":332,"updated_at":333,"created_at":334,"other_lang":335},28,"What is Consolidation Shipping Service?","This article outlines the process and benefits of Consolidation Shipping, a service that combines multiple packages for shipping. It covers the differences between consolidation, freight forwarding, and transshipment, and provides details on the consolidation process, pricing, customs duties, and compensation for damaged or lost items.","Consolidation Shipping, Transshipment, Freight Forwarding, Warehouse, Packaging, Inspection, Weight Reduction, Volumetric Weight, Customs Duties, Compensation","https://static-global.zingfront.com/handhunt/blogs/handhunt-9f8e162c.png",1728963366,1718968779,{"cn":318},{"id":337,"uri":315,"category_id":286,"title":338,"description":339,"keywords":340,"lang":161,"head_image":341,"updated_at":342,"created_at":343,"other_lang":344},33,"What is taobao？","Taobao and Tmall, two major e-commerce platforms under Alibaba Group, offer diverse products and focus on brands. Taobao caters to individual sellers while Tmall integrates branded merchants, providing authentic products and quality services. Both platforms play a pivotal role in the Chinese e-commerce market.","taobao usa, taobao english site, best e commerce platform, brand focus, focused brand, quality technology services, market leader, ","https://static-global.zingfront.com/handhunt/blogs/handhunt-405c1683.png",1721904599,1718968815,{"cn":307},{"id":346,"uri":347,"category_id":286,"title":348,"description":349,"keywords":350,"lang":161,"head_image":351,"updated_at":352,"created_at":353,"other_lang":354},34,"/blogs/what-is-1688","What is 1688?","1688, a leading B2B e-commerce platform under Alibaba Group, connects buyers and sellers globally for wholesale sourcing. It offers direct access to manufacturers, distributors, and wholesalers, enabling small businesses to procure competitively priced goods and enhance their market competitiveness.","1688.com, wholesale supplies plus, international marketplace, manufacturing or warehouse jobs","https://static-global.zingfront.com/handhunt/blogs/handhun