ome furnishings, etc. It offers consumers a more favorable price and diverse choices.","etsy careers, etsy jewelry, handicrafts, HandHunt,","https://static-global.zingfront.com/handhunt/blogs/handhunt-5659406b.png",1721874642,1718970067,{"cn":394},"/blogs/what-is-etsy-and-what-can-i-buy-through-handhunt-cn",{"id":396,"uri":394,"category_id":297,"title":397,"description":398,"keywords":399,"lang":175,"head_image":400,"updated_at":401,"created_at":402,"other_lang":403},42,"什么是Etsy？通过HandHunt我都可以买到什么内容","Etsy是手工艺与创意的电商平台，HandHunt代购平台提供与Etsy相似商品，涵盖珠宝、家居等，价格更优惠，为消费者带来多样化选择。","Etsy, 手工艺, 创意, HandHunt, 代购平台, 多样化商品, 价格优势","https://static-global.zingfront.com/handhunt/blogs/handhunt-2adb1a3d.png",1721886257,1718970189,{"en":386},{"id":405,"uri":406,"category_id":173,"title":407,"description":408,"keywords":409,"lang":175,"head_image":410,"updated_at":411,"created_at":412,"other_lang":413},43,"/manual/what-is-purchasing-agent-service-what-is-the-process-cn","什么是代购？流程是什么？","HandHunt，连接东西方创意的桥梁，提供代购服务，支持多币种支付，快速送达海外商品。提供商品信息、代购、物流、质检等服务，助力海外用户轻松购买中国商品。","HandHunt, 代购平台, 连接东西方创意, Etsy相似商品, 多样化商品选择, 币种付款, 国际物流服务","https://static-global.zingfront.com/handhunt/blogs/handhunt-e4568184.png",1723176145,1719227016,{"en":414},"/manual/what-is-purchasing-agent-service-what-is-the-process",{"id":416,"uri":414,"category_id":157,"title":417,"description":418,"keywords":419,"lang":161,"head_image":420,"updated_at":421,"created_at":422,"other_lang":423},44,"What is Purchasing Agent Service? What is the Process?","Purchasing Agent Service, known as daigou, is a service that allows customers to hire agents to buy products on their behalf. This is done for various reasons like product availability, price differences, or saving time. The process involves clarifying product requirements, submitting a purchase request, negotiating fees, placing an order, inspecting goods, and arranging shipping.","Daigou, Product Requirements, Purchase Request, Negotiate Fees, Payment Method, Place Order, Inspect Goods, Warehousing","https://static-global.zingfront.com/handhunt/blogs/handhunt-866c496d.png",1723176148,1719227558,{"cn":406},{"id":425,"uri":426,"category_id":173,"title":427,"description":428,"keywords":429,"lang":175,"head_image":430,"updated_at":431,"created_at":432,"other_lang":433},45,"/manual/shipping-restrictions-cn","寄送限制","本文档详细列出了《中华人民共和国禁止进出境物品表》和《中华人民共和国限制进出境物品表》，自一九九三年三月一日起施行。文中明确规定了禁止和限制进出境的各类物品，包括武器、毒品、有害物品、珍贵文物、动植物及其制品等，旨在维护国家安全和公共利益，确保进出口活动的合法性和规范性。","寄送限制、禁止进出境物品、限制进出境物品、法律法规、海关总署","https://static-global.zingfront.com/handhunt/blogs/handhunt-039d3298.png",1728899424,1719281874,{"en":434},"/manual/shipping-restrictions",{"id":436,"uri":434,"category_id":157,"title":437,"description":438,"keywords":439,"lang":161,"head_image":440,"updated_at":431,"created_at":441,"other_lang":442},46,"Shipping Restrictions"," China imposes strict restrictions on imported and exported goods to ensure compliance with the List of Prohibited and Restricted Items for Import and Export of the People's Republic of China. Imports prohibited include weapons, ammunition, explosives, counterfeit currency, printed materials harmful to politics, economy, culture, and morality, narcotics, animals and plants carrying dangerous pathogens, and more. Meanwhile, exports of state secrets and precious cultural relics are also prohibited. These regulations aim to safeguard national security, public interests, and human and animal health.","Shipping Restrictions, Import and Export Prohibitions, China Customs, Weapons, Narcotics, Pathogens, Human Health","https://static-global.zingfront.com/handhunt/blogs/handhunt-b19dbea5.png",1719282357,{"cn":426},{"id":444,"uri":445,"category_id":173,"title":446,"description":447,"keywords":448,"lang":175,"head_image":449,"updated_at":450,"created_at":451,"other_lang":452},47,"/manual/disclaimer-cn","免责声明","HandHunt通过优质的第三方买手公司提供代购服务，这些买手经过平台培训与监管，提供采购及售后等服务。但请注意，HandHunt上的代购商品均来自第三方平台，与版权或知识产权相关的问题，HandHunt及买手公司均不承担法律责任。","HandHunt, 第三方买手公司, 代购订单, 培训与